001000*                                                            *
001100*D   SPCSEPAY           EDI   PAYMENT TERMS SUBPROGRAM       *
001200*                                                            *
001300*D    THIS PROGRAM IS USED TO ADD/MODIFY/DELETE EDI CODES    *
001400*D    FOR PAYMENT TERMS.                                     *
001500*D                                                           *
      *D    ** COPIED FROM SEDIPAY AND MODIFIED **                 *
      *D                                                           *
001600*D    THIS PROGRAM IS CALLED BY:                             *
001700*D                      1.  SPCSPAYT                         *
001800*D                                                           *
001900**************************************************************
002000
002100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZSTARTUP-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

            SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-O
                ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
002500
002600 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                   PIC X(2000).

       FD  MPLTINFO-PK-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-PK-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.
002800
